# fixedbugs, defect 588, lane b19-dep, 2026-10-10 (panel 208's R2).
#
# SYMPTOM: beside the binding never called, the same function called: clang
# refused the call and the probe both, exit 2; told once now, on the binding,
# not at each line of the unit that names it.
#
